00:13:36,000 --> 00:13:37,000
My name is Jason Pettis.

151
00:13:37,000 --> 00:13:41,000
I'm Scoutmaster of Troop 130 in Golden Colorado.

152
00:13:41,000 --> 00:13:47,000
